spoiler":false,"text":"零とは幼稚舎での同級生で、その頃のいざこざから零を敵視していた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"フェンシング部のエースで、実力は全国レベル。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"男っぽいことにコンプレックスを抱いており、「かっこいい」 と言われると落ち込んでしまう。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"女子一同が “翼様ファンクラブ” を結成しているのも落ち込む原因の一つ。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"12956","sourceWorkId":"13542","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"被当作男孩子养育长大的大小姐。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"小的时候由于她体弱多病，父母出于对她的担心听从了占卜师的劝告，把她当作男孩子来养育。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"和零从幼儿园开始就已经是同级生，然而因为小时候的一点争执，一直把零列入敌视对象。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"对于自己的男孩子气这一点，她本人其实有点自卑，一旦被说成「好帅呀」，马上就会变得沮丧。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"当然，由清一色女孩子组成的“翼大人粉丝团”也是让她不禁沮丧的原因之一。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"击剑部的尖子选手，实力已经到了全国性比赛的级别。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"12723"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"83 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"12956","sourceWorkId":"13542","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"158 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"12956","sourceWorkId":"13542","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"80 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"12956","sourceWorkId":"13542","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"55 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"12956","sourceWorkId":"13542","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"体重（本版本）","value":"43 kg","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"12956","sourceWorkId":"13542","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d0/d045cc7420d7b82d713f6be116c9d2f6010073cfeae4c939373e70bf2b2c2da5.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d1/d12555b8ad9efaf485aefb337cd2da2553f05dc2049e5a5884cc879852711b10.webp","width":120,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"岩村琴美","creatorId":"vndb:s1172","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1172","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1172","name":"岩村 琴美","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:14413:12723:4813:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c6892","characterName":"本多 零","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"36766","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"14413"}],"egsCharacterIds":["12958"],"vndbCharacterId":"c6892"},"originalCharacterName":"本多 零","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"180"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"},"weight":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"65"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"母は発明家の本多真希子。 父は有名な国際派俳優・本多純一郎。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"多忙な両親は常に不在がちだが、義理の妹・世枝瑠、母の助手である杏夏、メイドロボ・ショコラ、その他大勢の使用人たちと共に大豪邸で暮らしている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"頭脳明晰、運動神経抜群の超エリート。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"端正なルックスで女子のファンも多いが、それを鼻にかけることはない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"基本的にまじめで優しい性格。 真実を追究する癖がある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"サッカー部、馬術部、推理同好会など、様々なクラブに所属している （勧誘が多く、断りきれずに入部した） が、基本的に帰宅部である。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"12958","sourceWorkId":"13542","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"本多 零 （ほんだ れい）"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"母亲是发明家本多真希子，父亲是有名的国际派演员·本多纯一郎。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"父母经常因为繁忙不在家，和义妹世枝瑠，母亲的助手杏夏，妹抖机器人ショコラ和其他众多的用人在大豪宅生活着。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"头脑明晰，运动神经出众的超杰出人物。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"外表英挺的他女孩子的爱好者很多，但本人并不炫耀。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"基本上是认真温柔的性格。有着追求真实的癖性。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"足球部，马术部，推理同好会等，从属于众多的俱乐部（经常被邀请，因为不能拒绝而加入部），基本属于归宅部。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"36766"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"180 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"12958","sourceWorkId":"13542","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"体重（本版本）","value":"65 kg","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"12958","sourceWorkId":"13542","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/75/75e34a879186a22cb38f0e032ae6d0a1c078a980eff30e78003561938564c255.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/de/de29a5a3a2af4ce2fe0e6316edab1e62865ceac8fbb84b0eedc27ca36c94616d.webp","width":118,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"岸尾だいすけ","creatorId":"vndb:s88","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s88","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s88","name":"岸尾 だいすけ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:14413:36766:3826:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c86210","characterName":"リサ＝リサ＝ギムレット","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"139767","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"14413"}],"egsCharacterIds":["12962"],"vndbCharacterId":"c86210"},"originalCharacterName":"リサ＝リサ＝ギムレット","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"零のクラスメイト。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"言動がかなり常人離れしているが、表向きはイギリス人のお嬢様を装っているため、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"その言葉遣いも日本語があまり得意でないせいだと解釈されている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ダジャレが好きで、ダジャレを言われると一人でいつまでも笑っていたりする。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"12962","sourceWorkId":"13542","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"零的同学。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"言行脱离常识，表面上是英国人的大小姐，因此解释那是不擅长日语的原因。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"喜欢冷笑话，经常一个人说冷笑话一边自己傻乎乎地笑。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"139767"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/86/86c95dde7cd68fd2a6f34344ab1e0833c14e6f139bc4c1d7ad6f499100b3d0b4.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b9/b9c9012a86f89f184c7821af8d4a811a4ca2dc06561640039beeb996b75bf00b.webp","width":123,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_c86211","characterName":"ショコラ","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"139766","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"14413"}],"egsCharacterIds":["12961"],"vndbCharacterId":"c86211"},"originalCharacterName":"ショコラ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"零の母が作った、明るい性格のメイド型ロボット。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"甘い物好きな零の母がショコラと名づけた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ちなみに他のモデルにもスイーツの名前を付けている。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"12961","sourceWorkId":"13542","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"零母亲制作的，性格开朗的妹抖型机器人。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"喜欢甜东西的母亲称之为ショコラ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"以及其他的模型也起着甜点的名字。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"139766"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/05/05898a2004297df04b6c6ad76651215f103ebb9a9e3ebc59466e001c59b2d498.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/26/268274a891d4f21ca6f8b82078deefecad87af9a765c1d56f9bc1c7880fcef2d.webp","width":125,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_c86212","characterName":"涼音 クルミ","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"139769","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"14413"}],"egsCharacterIds":["12964"],"vndbCharacterId":"c86212"},"originalCharacterName":"涼音 クルミ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"性格は唯我独尊、傍若無人、猪突猛進。 常に新聞部のカメラマンを子分のように従えている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「完璧超人の本多零にもどこかに弱点があるはず」 と、零のスキャンダルを狙っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかし、零を追っているといつも強風が吹き、スカートがめくれてしまうというパンツキャラ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"結局新聞でスクープされるのは、いつも自分のパンツなのだった。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"12964","sourceWorkId":"13542","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"性格唯我独尊，旁若无人，无敌鲁莽，「マトリエル学園第一怪人」的名声广为流传。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"经常把新闻部的记者当做自己的部下般统率。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"【被称作完美超人的本多零绝对会有弱点的，就让我揭发出来吧！】，以零的丑闻为目标。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"但追赶零的时候总是会被强风吹起裙子露出内裤。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"结果新闻发表的时候揭露的总是自己的内裤。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"139769"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/33/33ef152951f6f5d6d69f1de9f04a9745859a113d5933ca1069c333a831dfa9c6.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/80/80044738d4b9d5ad1f2e11bf46c834b90c1d9c35e6b0461e3ef32d1a3c679317.webp","width":118,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"平田由季","creatorId":"vndb:s899","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s899","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s899","name":"佐藤千幸","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:14413:139769:5501:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c86213","characterName":"高屋敷 楓","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"139768","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"14413"}],"egsCharacterIds":["12963"],"vndbCharacterId":"c86213"},"originalCharacterName":"高屋敷 楓","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"まじめで地味な風紀委員。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"いつもクラスメイトの服装の乱れなどを注意している。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"制服を着崩している風魔と仲が悪い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"いつも不機嫌な印象があるが、こう見えても零のファン。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"風魔に “零ヲタ” と呼ばれている。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"12963","sourceWorkId":"13542","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"认真严厉的风纪委员。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"总是在监督着学生们的制服的整洁等。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"和穿着邋遢制服的風魔关系很坏。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"虽然总是一副冷冷的面孔，不过其实是零的爱慕者。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"風魔称之为「零控」。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"139768"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/72/72418ec62228cec600de67df169a24d734cbde22bc09c561f187852d3d26f2f1.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/40/407d854681aa85966f91b1375b05e4dd3c738cdd7ed52acd4dae92d3735eee40.webp","width":124,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_c86214","characterName":"緑川 風子","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"139770","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"14413"}],"egsCharacterIds":["12965"],"vndbCharacterId":"c86214"},"originalCharacterName":"緑川 風子","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"ナイスバディで巨乳。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"優しくておっとりとした担任教師。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"12965","sourceWorkId":"13542","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"超级巨乳。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"性格温柔大方的老师。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"139770"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/0e/0ec100094da812a6fdbe10d3a